        "Content": "Built in 1920s and fully refurbished A-rated home with large extension in 2025\r\nExtending to c. 201 sq.m.\r\nFour double bedrooms, four bathrooms \r\nA short walk to the Wexford coastline at Blackhall Beach \r\n\r\nOutside\r\nLarge granite patio with seating wall surround.\r\nStone from the original cottage in the surround walls\r\nGate and post entrance driveway with pedestrian pathway entrance\r\nFootpath surround\r\nSite extends to 0.56 Acres\r\nThe benefit of granted planning permission for a car port and garage. \r\n\r\nServices\r\nMains water\r\nTPW Euro tank Treatment Plant\r\nSamsung Air to water heat pump system.\r\nUnderfloor heating on ground floor and radiator heating upstairs\r\nFibre broadband available"
